msgid "Search, filter, and sort"
msgstr ""

msgid "Use Display Builder to enable live search, city and group filters, and sorting. On tables, visitors can also click sortable column headers to switch between ascending and descending order. These controls work with pagination and update the displayed results without reloading the page."
msgstr ""

